<programme start="20261026140000 +0000" stop="20261026170000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Texas A&amp;M at Alabama</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Texas A&amp;M Aggies meet the No. 13 Alabama Crimson Tide in an SEC regular-season clash at Bryant-Denny Stadium. Texas A&amp;M holds alternate win-loss records in their last four games, while Alabama relies on Keelon Russell to break a two-game skid.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
