<programme start="20261026120000 +0000" stop="20261026140000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">Let It Snow</title><desc lang="es">An executive examines her company&apos;s new property and prepares a presentation to transform the rustic lodge into a new hot spot. She tries to ignore the lodge&apos;s festive celebrations during her stay, but an unexpected romance changes her heart.</desc><credits><actor>Candace Cameron Bure</actor><actor>Jesse Hutch</actor><actor>Alan Thicke</actor></credits><date>20130101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Holidays</category><category lang="es">Drama</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p10252530_p_v8_ac.jpg"/></programme>
