<programme start="20261026104900 +0000" stop="20261026113600 +0000" channel="ID 🇲🇽"><title lang="es">Mar de crímenes</title><sub-title lang="es">El último respiro</sub-title><desc lang="es">Tras oír los rumores de infidelidad, Jeff Skelton intentará todo para evitar que su familia se destruya.</desc><date>20220101</date><category lang="es">Series/Thriller</category><category lang="es">Series</category><category lang="es">Series/History</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.1.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E02</episode-num><icon src="https://www.izzigo.tv/images/repository/357/20030357-SNAPSHOT-l.jpg"/></programme>
