<programme start="20261026120000 +0000" stop="20261026130000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Air Disasters</title><sub-title lang="en">Collision Catastrophe</sub-title><desc lang="en">Two planes collide in the sky above southern Germany and numerous people on the ground witness the disaster; based on the wreckage, it is clear that the planes collided in the air; the researchers encounter a mystery.</desc><category lang="en">History</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p203985_b_v7_ed.jpg"/></programme>
